<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Blog | PDFPro</title>
<link rel="canonical" href="https://www.pdfproapp.com/blog/"/>
<link rel="alternate" hreflang="he" href="https://www.pdfproapp.com/he/blog/"/>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
:root{--red:#E02020;--navy:#0D1B2A;--cream:#F8F5F0;--border:#D8D0C4;--text:#0D1B2A;--muted:#5A6A7A}
body{font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;background:var(--cream);color:var(--text);direction:ltr}

nav{background:#0D1B2A;padding:0 2rem;height:60px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:2px solid #E02020;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100}
.logo{font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:900;color:white;text-decoration:none}.logo span{color:#FF4444}
.back-btn{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);text-decoration:none;font-size:0.9rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.4rem}
.back-btn:hover{color:white}

.container{max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;padding:3rem 1.5rem}
h1{font-size:2rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1.5rem;letter-spacing:-0.5px}
h2{font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin:1.8rem 0 0.6rem}
p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:0.8rem}
.card{background:white;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1.2rem;margin-bottom:0.8rem}
.card h3{font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:0.4rem}
.grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--red);color:white;padding:0.8rem 2rem;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;margin-top:1rem}
details{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin-bottom:0.8rem;background:white}
summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;color:var(--navy);list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
details p{margin-top:0.8rem}
input,textarea{width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:0.95rem;margin-bottom:0.8rem;background:white;direction:ltr}
.send-btn{background:var(--red);color:white;border:none;border-radius:8px;padding:0.85rem 2rem;font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;width:100%}
.blog-card{background:white;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1rem;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color 0.2s}
.blog-card:hover{border-color:var(--red)}
.blog-card h2{margin-top:0.4rem;font-size:1.05rem}
.blog-card p{font-size:0.88rem}
@media(max-width:600px){.grid-2{grid-template-columns:1fr}.container{padding:2rem 1rem}h1{font-size:1.5rem}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>
  <a href="/" class="logo">PDF<span>Pro</span></a>
  <a href="/" class="back-btn">← Back to site</a>
</nav>
<div class="container">
  <h1>Blog</h1>
  
<p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">Tips, tutorials and updates from the PDFPro team.</p>
<div class="blog-card" onclick="window.location.href='/compress-pdf/'">
  <p style="font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--muted)">May 20, 2026</p>
  <h2>How to reduce PDF file size without losing quality</h2>
  <p>Learn the best strategies for compressing PDFs while maintaining readability and visual quality.</p>
  <p style="color:var(--red);font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.8rem">Try the tool &rarr;</p>
</div>
<div class="blog-card" onclick="window.location.href='/ocr-pdf/'">
  <p style="font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--muted)">May 15, 2026</p>
  <h2>OCR for Hebrew documents: a complete guide</h2>
  <p>Everything you need to know about extracting Hebrew text from scanned documents and images.</p>
  <p style="color:var(--red);font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.8rem">Try the tool &rarr;</p>
</div>
<div class="blog-card" onclick="window.location.href='/pdf-to-word/'">
  <p style="font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--muted)">May 8, 2026</p>
  <h2>PDF to Word: when it works and when it doesn't</h2>
  <p>Understanding the limitations of PDF conversion and how to get the best results every time.</p>
  <p style="color:var(--red);font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.8rem">Try the tool &rarr;</p>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>